## What this service does

- polls `{{ database_operation.qualifiedTableName }}` with an initial snapshot plus incremental watermark strategy
- exposes `POST /internal/database/poll-now` for controlled verification
- publishes canonical events to Solace topics
- keeps prior row state in memory to derive row-level and column-level change events
- exposes health and metrics endpoints

