## Runtime assumptions

- ordering uses `{{ database_config.watermarkColumn }}` plus `{{ database_config.idColumn }}`
- the generated runtime is read-only against PostgreSQL
- watermark state is held in memory for the life of the process
- previously seen rows are held in memory so per-column change detection works across poll cycles

